		{
			dependencies: ["0650996C7818ADB5"]
			description: [
				"&e冶金注入器&r是&cMekanism&r中用于制作关键组件的核心机器，也是生产&7钢&r的主要途径"
				""
				"通过将材料（&c中间左侧&r栏）与注入剂（&b最左侧&r栏）结合来使用。"
				""
				"需要 &e电力&r，可以通过电缆从诸如 &7风力发电机&r&7等&r来源获取。"
				""
				"使用 &6Transporters&r 和 &dConfigurater&r 来自动化物品的输入/输出。"
			]
			id: "162CE44400A63575"
			rewards: [{
				id: "00DE51121BDC8B62"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "初始机器 (The Starting Machine)"
			tasks: [{
				id: "28277BA9F319240D"
				item: "mekanism:metallurgic_infuser"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -13.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["685159786B4BCA0A"]
			description: ["&bEnrichment Chamber&r 的功能与其他模组中的 &8Pulverizer&r 类似。它将 &bminerals&r 转化为富集形式，供 &eMetallurgic Infuser&r 使用，并将 &n&a3&r &araw ores&r&r 转化为 &n&a4&r &ad&r&austs&r&r，用于制作和其他机器。它是你 Ore Factory 的基础，并可升级为 &4factory&r 以获得更多处理槽位。"]
			id: "08DDE018A804BFE7"
			min_width: 300
			rewards: [{
				id: "31D2CAFD4780F581"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "将原始矿石破碎成粉尘"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1AE233B4CCFE99F7"
				item: "mekanism:enrichment_chamber"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -8.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["685159786B4BCA0A"]
			description: [
				"&6锇压缩机&r用于制造&d精炼黑曜石锭&r和&e萤石锭&r。"
				""
				"它将液态&b锇&r（将&b锇&r锭放入机器&n底部&r槽中熔炼而成）与原始材料融合，以创造相应的锭。"
			]
			id: "195729280394ABFB"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7063D1659463D311"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "6934C61AFEB0443D"
				item: "mekanism:osmium_compressor"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -10.5d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6C25D42C36175BF4"]
			description: [
				"The &9Crusher&r crushes, among other things, &3Ores&r into &7Dirty Dusts&r, &aIngots&r into &eDusts&r and &6Biomatter&r into &2Bio Fuel&r."
				""
				"这能将&o&bclumps&r转化为&o&bdirty dust&r，然后放入&dEnrichment Chamber&r生成&o&bore dust&r，再将其熔炼成&aingot&r。"
			]
			id: "7AE502EDB73BD57A"
			rewards: [{
				id: "108F3890E3472530"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "是时候粉碎一切了"
			tasks: [{
